---
/**
 * Etymology section: Tamil and Japanese readings of the same sound, with a
 * seed note pinned to data-scope="name-origin". On wide screens the note sits
 * between the two words; narrower grids reorder that home into the flow.
 */
---
<section id="name" class="wrap name">
  <div class="kicker">About the name</div>
  <div class="pair" data-scope="name-origin">
    <div class="word word-ta"><span class="glyphs" lang="ta">குறிப்பு</span><span class="gloss"><i>ku&#7775;ippu</i> &middot; Tamil &middot; a note</span></div>
    <!-- Wide-layout note home; the board may also use it as a flow slot when compact. -->
    <div class="note-home" data-flow="name-origin" hidden></div>
    <div class="word word-ja"><span class="glyphs" lang="ja">クリップ</span><span class="gloss"><i>kurippu</i> &middot; Japanese &middot; a clip</span></div>
  </div>
  <p>Same sound, two languages, and between them the whole idea: a note, clipped to a page.</p>
</section>

<style>
  .name {
    padding-top: 120px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .pair {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    align-items: start;
    gap: 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-divider);
    padding-top: 24px;
  }
  .word { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .note-home {
    position: relative;
    width: 236px;
    min-height: 96px;
    justify-self: center;
  }
  .note-home[hidden] { display: none; }
  /* Mid widths: two word columns, note home spanning the row below. */
  @media (min-width: 620px) and (max-width: 759px) {
    .pair { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .word-ja { grid-column: 2; justify-self: end; }
    .note-home { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-row: 2; }
  }
  /* Wide: note home sits in the center column between the two words. */
  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .pair { grid-template-columns: 1fr 236px 1fr; }
    .word-ja { grid-column: 3; justify-self: end; }
    .note-home { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; }
  }
  .glyphs { font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 400; }
  .gloss { font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-neutral-800); }
  p { margin: 0; text-align: center; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; text-wrap: pretty; }
</style>
